{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Hey Dave! Met with the creative team for my album yesterday. It was a long session, but awesome to see everything coming together."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-a310933368cdbacb49cc8c65", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.605963+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a310933368cdbacb49cc8c65", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a310933368cdbacb49cc8c65", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Hey Cal! Sounds great that your album's coming along. Are you feeling good about it? Here's a pic I just took."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-50f4ac8ff65bd187a323ee54", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.625421+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "50f4ac8ff65bd187a323ee54", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "50f4ac8ff65bd187a323ee54", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Dave, thanks for checking in. I'm feeling stoked about this album! We've been making some magic with a team in the studio, working on the music and everything. Look at what a wonderful studio we have! How have you been? Anything new since we talked?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-b01998b0340b5cb3595f760e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.638926+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b01998b0340b5cb3595f760e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b01998b0340b5cb3595f760e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Hey, nice photo of the studio! Working in a team yields incredible results, well done! Keep pushing it! I've been doing good - thanks for asking. I've been exploring some parks on the weekends to relax - it's so peaceful being surrounded by nature. Are there any chill spots you enjoy in Boston?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-ae60c72bda0282e2e06c5cbe", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.653827+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ae60c72bda0282e2e06c5cbe", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ae60c72bda0282e2e06c5cbe", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Thanks! That studio is great for creativity. I've never been to Boston before, but I hear the parks are amazing. Can't wait to visit next month. Anything cool you remember about Boston parks?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-b94e860e0b0c043f2c00d960", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.670571+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b94e860e0b0c043f2c00d960", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b94e860e0b0c043f2c00d960", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: That sounds great! The Boston parks are awesome, especially in spring. It's so serene when you're walking around. I went for a stroll last Friday and it was amazing. It's so magical - I bet you'll love it! I love taking walks on the weekends, they recharge me for the entire upcoming week!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-07331081d586dcb21c4fb45e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.683170+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "07331081d586dcb21c4fb45e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "07331081d586dcb21c4fb45e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: I'm excited to experience that serenity. I can't wait to take a walk in the parks and recharge. Hey, have you been on any hikes lately?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-c479493baf5712459461172f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.698675+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c479493baf5712459461172f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c479493baf5712459461172f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Nah, haven't gone hiking recently, but it's awesome - being in nature and pushing yourself to new heights. Clears your mind and brings a sense of calm. Have you been to the mountains before? Heard they're super chill."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-56c3a0e9bbe56dc6cf02f00f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.711832+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "56c3a0e9bbe56dc6cf02f00f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "56c3a0e9bbe56dc6cf02f00f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Nah, haven't been to the mountains but I'm keen to go. Looking for a way to escape it all and de-stress. I want to go on a hike to a place similar to this. What's new and exciting happening for you, Dave?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-8fde690dfe4a3680ff42f82a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.724464+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8fde690dfe4a3680ff42f82a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8fde690dfe4a3680ff42f82a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: I booked a trip to a mountainous region for next month! Finally gonna be able to see those majestic peaks! Gonna be an amazing experience!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-54896a37abf488bb5a5059e6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.738571+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "54896a37abf488bb5a5059e6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "54896a37abf488bb5a5059e6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Cool, Dave! Have a great time. I'm sure it's going to be an amazing experience. Take lots of pics and show me when you get back."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-1a7637d52208daef89fbda4c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.751570+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1a7637d52208daef89fbda4c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1a7637d52208daef89fbda4c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Yep, Calvin! Gonna take lots of pics. Can't wait to show you when I get back!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-d0a7100274a3204e209e14ff", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.764569+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d0a7100274a3204e209e14ff", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d0a7100274a3204e209e14ff", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Have fun exploring the mountains, Dave! Safe travels and see you soon. Take care!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-a2ce1ad6371e4c9f40ba4423", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.775670+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a2ce1ad6371e4c9f40ba4423", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a2ce1ad6371e4c9f40ba4423", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin! Take care, see you soon!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-50/session_8-c3c1fc1d9daa6f1595eb573e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:47:28.785223+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c3c1fc1d9daa6f1595eb573e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c3c1fc1d9daa6f1595eb573e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
